      "img": "icons/magic/light/explosion-beam-impact-silhouette.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>You can take the Cast Action to conjure a Summon, a Being with HD: (your Level or lower), spending Mana to do so equal to its HD. You must conduct a 10-minute Ritual to determine your Summon before doing so. The following rules apply to your Summon:</p><ul><li><p>You command it as an Action or by skipping your Move.</p></li><li><p>It uses your Cast Skill for Checks and Saves.</p></li><li><p>You must Focus on it, spending 1 Mana to do so each Turn. Otherwise, it is banished.</p></li><li><p>When it is reduced to 0 HP, it is banished.</p></li><li><p>Abilities that recharge or have limited uses do not recharge by banishing and resummoning the same statblock.</p></li></ul>",
